{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7ad9aa9dc5a833d9feb","chatId":"4b3020139a6d44c1964b625fc176a031","sessionId":null,"userId":99722,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2584,"promptTokens":560,"completionTokens":347,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020323223106311284,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7ad9aa9dc5a833d9fea","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484141470,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7ad9aa9dc5a833d9fea","chatId":"4b3020139a6d44c1964b625fc176a031","sessionId":null,"userId":99722,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n琳琳被诊断出患有一种疾病，导致她的腿几乎无法移动。她一直在寻找恢复腿部功能的方法，访问了不同的专家。昨天，她正在厨房餐具室和她的姐姐聊天，一边吃晚饭，突然接到了医院的电话。医院告诉她，专家可能找到了解决她困境的办法。琳琳听后马上把手机丢了，然后哭泣起来，双手捂住了脸。看到她这个样子，琳琳的姐姐立刻走到她身边，紧紧地抱住了她。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，琳琳的姐姐最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 好奇 & 反对\nB) 紧张 & 好奇\nC) 充满希望 & 反对\nD) 充满希望 & 感激\nE) 开心 & 好奇\nF) 开心 & 感激\n\n## 问题 2\n琳琳的姐姐为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 对于她的姐姐，没有可用的治疗方法 & 琳琳的姐姐对医疗治疗的成本感到担忧。\nB) 她的姐姐可以接受可能治愈她的治疗 & 对于她的姐姐，没有可用的治疗方法\nC) 她很担心妹妹哭 & 对于她的姐姐，没有可用的治疗方法\nD) 她很担心妹妹哭 & 她想知道妹妹为什么哭\nE) 她很担心妹妹哭 & 她的姐姐可以接受可能治愈她的治疗\nF) 她在想为什么她的姐姐会掉下她的手机 & 她的姐姐可以接受可能治愈她的治疗","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020323223106311284,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7ad9aa9dc5a833d9feb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484141468,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b2e2ad560f21437c8ca4e38975e84283"}